  "referenceNumber": "SUD0048",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State has reasonable grounds to suspect that Hussein Abo Jalak is an involved person under the Sudan (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2020\n because he is or has been involved in a relevant activity, namely being responsible for the commission of violations of international humanitarian law in Sudan,\n  through his role as a Rapid Support Forces commander including during the systematic campaign of violence against civilians in El Fasher.\n",
